*.exe
*.bin
*.pdb
*.dll
odlox
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
# Bytecode cache (docs/plans/bytecode-cache.md) -- generated, mirrors
# the reference implementation's own .gitignore treatment of the same directory name.
__loxcache__/
# test_type.py's fixture (lox/type.lox) opens this relative to cwd --
# same artifact the reference implementation's own .gitignore excludes for the same reason.
tests/new_tests/tmp
# bin/dist.sh's bundled output -- generated, zippable folders for handing
# a script to someone without this repo (see bin/dist.sh's own header).
dist/
# Raw ZX Spectrum game snapshots (e.g. lox_examples/manic_miner/*.sna) --
# copyrighted commercial game data, kept local only. extract_cavern.lox
# reads one to produce the (committed) caverns/*.json data.
*.sna
